## Shared Requirements
- Public retrieval excludes products belonging to inactive stores.
- Vendor retrieval requires authenticated ownership.
- Internal retrieval has explicit authorization and visibility semantics.
- Collection retrieval supports bounded pagination and stable sorting.
- Filters and sort fields are validated.
- Store activity is obtained through the Store client/port, not duplicated as an independent source of truth.
- Avoid separate use cases when the same behavior can be expressed cleanly through validated filters on an existing listing operation.